<title>UK: Pentland finance director plans to leave.</title>
<headline>Pentland finance director plans to leave.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Nov 8 Reuter) - British sports goods company Pentland Group said on Friday that Frank Farrant, its group finance managing director, had given notice of his intention to leave the group to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said that Farrant had given 18 months notice of quitting, under the terms of his contract.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
